@DomainCopilot.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5121

GET {{DomainCopilot.Api_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###
@DomainCopilot.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5121

GET {{DomainCopilot.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Receive a synthetic claim
POST {{DomainCopilot.Api_HostAddress}}/claims
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "claimNumber": "CLM-DEMO-001",
  "policyNumber": "POL-DEMO-001",
  "coverageCode": "WATER",
  "lossDate": "2025-06-15",
  "claimedAmount": 42000,
  "currency": "EGP",
  "description": "Synthetic water damage claim"
}

### Replace the ID with the one returned by Receive a synthetic claim
POST {{DomainCopilot.Api_HostAddress}}/claims/{{claimId}}/adjudicate
Accept: application/json

### List the human review queue
GET {{DomainCopilot.Api_HostAddress}}/review-queue
Accept: application/json
